OL,5,G0306 Outlook
OL,6,     FWhen Dutch writer Raoul de Jong
OL,7,     Ffirst met his dad, he warned him
OL,8,     Fabout a family curse: an ancestor
OL,9,     Fwho could turn himself into a
OL,10,     Fjaguar. Raoul went to Suriname to
OL,11,     Ftrack him down.
OL,12,G0350 Witness History
OL,13,     FIn 1946, Mexican-American Raoul
OL,14,     FCortez launched the first US radio
OL,15,     Fservice in Spanish. Based in San
OL,16,     FAntonio, Texas, he used charm and
OL,17,     Fcreativity to win over
OL,18,     Fadvertisers.
